---
title: The set
order: 1
---
<p>Each icon is decorative here, so the name beside it is the text.</p>
<ul role="list" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(9rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0; list-style: none">
	<li webc:for="name of ['accessibility', 'arrow-end', 'arrow-start', 'book', 'caution', 'check', 'chevron-down', 'chevron-end', 'copy', 'desktop', 'error', 'external', 'fill', 'hash', 'important', 'info', 'link', 'loading', 'moon', 'phone', 'search', 'success', 'sun', 'system', 'tablet', 'tip', 'warning']">
		<norn-icon :@name="name"></norn-icon> <code @text="name"></code>
	</li>
</ul>
